<title>USA: Triangle elects Patterson chairman.</title>
<headline>Triangle elects Patterson chairman.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triangle Bancorp Inc said it elected president and chief executive Michael Patterson to chairman of both Triangle Bank and Triangle Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>The company said Patterson's role as chairman will begin February 1.</p>
<p>Patterson joined Triangle as president in 1990 and was named CEO in 1991.</p>
